    Invulnerable: P J X toggle, gates damage (SAM1RE input.md);
    DoorKey: the door key (SAM1RE level-load.md);
    HitLock: hit/death lock (SAM1RE physics.md) }
  ArcLen: Byte; { @6A1C }
  Arc: array[1..35] of Integer; { @6A1E; indexed by ArcLen (main 0000:1B35) }
